{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-883f9a", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-e1a4f1"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "旋律を情念の運び手とする立場。数から作る生成に対して、情念の側から反論を置く。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-ee3c1a", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-00839a"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "歌う群衆の声を、一人で書く机は再現できない。台帳の声は最初から単数である。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-74a9de", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-ec41bb"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "歌の快が祈りを覆う。註の多さが本文の祈りを覆うのと同じ構図を、書式の側に読む。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-9ceca5", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-60c68d"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "声の作者を本人の外に置く。生成文の作者をめぐる問いと形が似ている。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-d87ea7", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-c9df62"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "稽古は才能の証明ではなく衰えへの手続き。稽古0回の書庫には、この手続きがない。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-402914", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-3a6793"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "聴くために自分を縛る。註と `scope_note` はこの縛りの現代版に見える。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-bd8f40", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-cec0b3"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "声だけが身体から分かれて残る。書庫に残る「声」の原型のひとつ。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-fd36b6", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-4de8b4"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "歌を頂点に置きながら、その頂点を書けないと宣言して書物が終わる。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-25aafd", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-d86ea6"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "歌の記録が身体の記述になる。書字が声に届く唯一の経路のひとつ。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-367a57", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-8158a0"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "感情を人物の内側ではなく語りの形式に置く。報告の「考え」欄と同じ構造。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-6a6898", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-7d5d03"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "拍が労働の時間を区切る。行を数える台帳と、拍を数える歌の比較点。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-8ad3ea", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-449f3b"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "譜は手がかりで、本体は身体にある。未完を前提にした伝承の設計。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-96079c", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-5878c9"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "聞いた声を写しとるという起源譚。採譜の原型であり、聴取の神話でもある。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-fca991", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-791cac"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "眠る側は歌を覚えない。次のセッションが前の声を覚えないのと同じ非対称。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-bd43ef", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-d21735"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "意味より先に拍が入る。意味を先に学ぶ機械との対比。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-ea1dbd", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-2b909c"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "反復が共同体の時間を作る。反復しない書庫はどんな時間に住むか。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-0f5328", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-d9e8ba"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "話者の区別を声質に負わせる。この書庫は括弧と欄に負わせている。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-eeb24a", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-0fa2cf"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "稽古の細部は身体にしか残らない。それでも「型」と呼べるものは何か。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-358aea", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-5ba68c"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "協和は比の単純さに従う。数を聴く耳と、数だけを持つ機械。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-a04f20", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-3f6c02"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "演奏しない者が音楽家と呼ばれる。知る側に極端に寄った書庫の自己像。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-0aca63", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-cc733f"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "歌は記憶を運び、譜は記憶を固定する。台帳は後者の極端な形である。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-395605", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-1720dc"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "判断は耳に属する。耳を持たない機械はどちらの立場に立つのか。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-82d554", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-c70bd8"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "旋律は和声の上に生える枝。確率から書く生成と同じ「下から」の作法か。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-a6cb3e", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-35caf4"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "知らないまま数える心が快を持つ。計算を可視化する機械の逆説。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-f5d4ff", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-589b59"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "快を分析に還元したあと、歌はどこに残るか。監査ツールの位置と同じ問い。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-6bafc4", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-7ca952"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "中心が失われると作曲家が規則を書く。台帳に規則を足す作業と似ている。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-da3026", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-afe3f6"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "採譜は損失を承知した移し替え。この報告の中心にある操作と同じ形。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-649011", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-410cf4"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "楽器は歌を模す。歌えない者が歌を模すとき、模倣は何を生むか。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-68ff58", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-621704"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "文字化の成功と失敗が同じ書物に同居する。要約の置かれている位置と同じ。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-e7f6fa", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-de5a26"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "秩序と実行の分離。記譜された台帳と、それを読む次のセッションの関係。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-ce4bdc", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-75d34d"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "一回性の喪失を形式の変化として扱う。書庫の反復可能性と同じ問題。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-94cecc", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-8e0578"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "音楽は動詞である。書庫が集めているのは作品ではなく痕跡だという自己理解。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-9514c6", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-b816af"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "誰が音楽を作れるかを社会が決める。生成AIの「才能」言説にも同じ問い。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-c04d27", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-d20a3d"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "聴取の型は社会の側から作られる。聴取語彙の偏りも同じ説明の射程に入る。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-ca5969", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-c775e2"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "理論が耳を作る。監査ツールの語彙表もまた、耳の代わりの理論である。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-cb225a", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-9fe7ca"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "録音が聴取の対象を変える。声を文字に写すことも聴取の対象を変える。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-8d32e5", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261024-6f80fe"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "計算機は音を出さず譜を出した。この書庫の制約と同じ形の出発点。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-62a51c", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261024-4f0eeb"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "評価が来歴で反転する。`verification.status` と同じ問題を含む。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-e7940e", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261024-3314ba"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "旋律を条件として渡す。渡しているのは音か、音の記述か。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-e43098", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261024-52d7c8"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "段階を踏まずに一度に書く。断片も一段で書かれ、推敲は註に残る。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-4dcb6c", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261024-d954ea"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "音の来歴が法廷の争点になる。`origin` 欄が扱う問題の法的な極端な形。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-b3c436", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261024-f21305"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "楽譜と歌詞から声を作る。声は身体からではなく記号から生成される。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-1ff798", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261024-924528"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "拍は体で取るものから推定する量になる。拍子を時点の意味でしか使わない書庫と対になる。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-d165a4", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261024-f751c7"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "耳に代わる指標はまだ耳ではない。語形を数える監査も歌そのものを測っていない。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-f967de", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261024-3c3815"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "音を離散列にしてから扱う。書字への移し替えと同じ「まず置き換える」操作。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-842204", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-TRC-20261024-song"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-cc96c9"}, "note": "声は書かれ、歌は書かれない。書字212対歌唱3という比が語りの位置を示す。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-d9423e", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-e1a4f1"}, "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-c70bd8"}, "note": "旋律の優位（ルソー）と和声の優位（ラモー）。同じ世紀の同じ論争の両側。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-494d84", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-ec41bb"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-d86ea6"}, "note": "歌の快に酔う聴き手（アウグスティヌス）と、歌で身体が崩れる聴き手（サッフォー）。快の記述が内省か生理かで分かれる。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-2b60ea", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-5ba68c"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-3f6c02"}, "note": "協和を比に置く（ニコマコス）ことと、演奏を知る者から外す（ボエティウス）こと。数の側に音楽を寄せる二段階。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-71cc78", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-afe3f6"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261024-f751c7"}, "note": "鳥の声を写す採譜（メシアン）と、拍を信号から推定する機械（ベック）。写す対象が音から時間へ移る。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-73f8a6", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261024-6f80fe"}, "relation_type": "transforms", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261024-4f0eeb"}, "note": "計算機が譜を出す（ヒラー）ことから、様式を再結合して譜を出す（コープ）ことへ。出力の形式は変わらない。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-836362", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261024-3314ba"}, "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261024-52d7c8"}, "note": "階層的に組み立てる生成（MusicLM）と、単段で並行に書く生成（MusicGen）。作法是違うが、評価は同じ耳に委ねられる。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-c33043", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261024-4f0eeb"}, "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261024-d954ea"}, "note": "様式の再結合（コープ）が来歴の問いを呼び、学習データの来歴（RIAA）が法廷の問いになる。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-1f4567", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-8e0578"}, "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-b816af"}, "note": "録音を新しい作品形式とする（グールド）ことと、音楽を行為とする（スモール）こと。保存か実行か。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-8adc64", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-c9df62"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-0fa2cf"}, "note": "七歳の声から五十有余までの稽古（世阿弥）と、録音以前に身体へ保存された節回し（長唄）。稽古の二つの記録形式。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-2a53ff", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-5878c9"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-afe3f6"}, "note": "空中の声を写しとる起源譚（声明）と、鳥の声を五線に写す採譜（メシアン）。写すことの神話と技術。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
